  "description": "Released in 1985, this adventure game puts you in the shoes of a detective dispatched from Scotland Yard to solve a murder case. The game uses a command-entry system, primarily utilizing \"noun + verb\" inputs, and supports both Kana and English.\n\nAs the company's second mystery adventure title, it follows its predecessor in receiving high acclaim for its writing. The ever-shifting scenario and its dramatic twists are absolute must-sees. The way the foreshadowing throughout the game leads to such unexpected connections is a narrative journey you won't want to miss.\n\nFor players seeking a mature adventure game experience, this title is a perfect fit.\n \n *This application does not have a scene select mode.\n *The main game and gallery screen (*Gallery) are in Japanese version.\n *Other menu screens and \"How to play\" screens are in English.",
